    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>Identity is a toolkit. So is hope.</em></p><p>You maintain a cache of prepared personas—faces, voices, and micro-histories.</p><ul><li>You can keep a number of <strong>personas</strong> equal to your <strong>tier</strong> “ready to run” at any given time, each with a name, demeanor, and short cover story.</li><li>During a <strong>Parley</strong>, infiltration, or social scene, you may spend <strong>10 Soft Power marks</strong> to switch into one of your cached personas as a <strong>bonus action</strong>.</li><li>When you do, you reroll the lowest die on your next <strong>Stealth (Intrigue)</strong> or <strong>Diplomacy (Presence)</strong> check in that scene.</li></ul><p>Personas do not grant mechanical disguises by themselves, but stack with mundane or magical disguise as the table allows.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"dwThousandPersona\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Persona Cache</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Per-scene swap (10 Soft Power marks) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Bonus action &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Maintain `tier` cached personas (name, demeanor, short cover). In a Parley / infiltration / social scene, spend 10 Soft Power marks to swap into a cached persona; reroll the lowest die on your next Stealth (Intrigue/Presence) or Diplomacy (Presence) check that scene.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
